- You guys go ahead.

9
00:02:32,960 --> 00:02:34,280
Come, Li.

10
00:02:34,360 --> 00:02:35,880
- Come on.
- That's correct.

11
00:02:37,440 --> 00:02:38,600
So beautiful.

12
00:02:39,960 --> 00:02:40,840
Congratulations.

13
00:02:41,720 --> 00:02:43,040
- Who's that?
- Xu Chi.

14
00:02:43,120 --> 00:02:45,000
- That's her?
- So young.

15
00:02:45,080 --> 00:02:46,080
Yet she's so capable.

16
00:02:57,520 --> 00:02:58,480
What's wrong?

17
00:02:59,840 --> 00:03:01,560
Don't want to see him looking all smug?

18
00:03:04,080 --> 00:03:04,920
Stay here with me for a bit.

19
00:03:06,360 --> 00:03:07,400
Okay.

20
00:03:20,720 --> 00:03:22,080
