21
00:03:23,520 --> 00:03:25,960
I'm thinking about
how much longer we have to wait.

22
00:03:28,240 --> 00:03:29,440
Before the fish takes the bait?

23
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:34,600
Then we'll need some patience.

24
00:03:36,600 --> 00:03:37,520
Yeah.

25
00:03:39,440 --> 00:03:40,720
They just signed the formal contract.

26
00:03:40,800 --> 00:03:42,720
They need to operate for a while.

27
00:03:43,400 --> 00:03:44,760
Once the numbers start looking bad,

28
00:03:44,840 --> 00:03:47,320
that's when we get our chance
to push him into the pit.

29
00:03:47,920 --> 00:03:50,160
You think it's taking too long
and you're getting restless?

30
00:03:51,080 --> 00:03:53,000
Aren't there still the Tianhe
and Morse projects?

31
00:03:55,280 --> 00:03:56,680
It's not that I'm getting restless.

32
00:03:58,960 --> 00:04:02,160
I'm afraid I won't have time
to enjoy being in love with you.

33
00:04:04,920 --> 00:04:07,640
Actually, I don't have
that much time for dating.

34
00:04:08,240 --> 00:04:09,520
I've got my own stuff to deal with.

35
00:04:10,360 --> 00:04:12,240
Maxmise's investigation results
still aren't out.

36
00:04:12,320 --> 00:04:15,320
The key issue is stuck on Yang Rui.

37
00:04:15,400 --> 00:04:18,079
He refuses to admit
that I have nothing to do with this.

38
00:04:18,600 --> 00:04:21,519
He insists that I wrote
that report with him

39
00:04:22,040 --> 00:04:23,480
under Ma Ke's orders.

40
00:04:26,000 --> 00:04:27,840
- Let me go talk to Mr. Pi.
- No.

41
00:04:27,920 --> 00:04:29,320
I still want to handle it myself.

42
00:04:31,680 --> 00:04:33,480
I don't want to sit around
waiting anymore.

43
00:04:34,000 --> 00:04:35,040
I want to go on the offensive.

44
00:04:35,120 --> 00:04:36,800
The consulting world is small.

45
00:04:36,880 --> 00:04:38,960
Even if Mr. Pi does you a favor this time,

46
00:04:39,040 --> 00:04:42,240
I'll always carry a stain
I can never wash off.

47
00:04:42,320 --> 00:04:46,000
Clearing your name yourself
is the only way that feels satisfying.

48
00:04:48,320 --> 00:04:49,360
You're right.

49
00:04:50,640 --> 00:04:51,920
What a stubborn little lion.

50
00:04:52,640 --> 00:04:53,720
Whatever you say.

51
00:04:57,840 --> 00:04:58,920
Then I'll go take a look.

52
00:05:03,520 --> 00:05:04,520
Look over there.

53
00:05:07,160 --> 00:05:11,120
A GENTLE BREEZE COMES

54
00:05:19,080 --> 00:05:24,880
THE SENTIMENTS LINGER

55
00:05:25,600 --> 00:05:26,640
Did you do this?

56
00:05:29,960 --> 00:05:30,880
No.

57
00:05:31,400 --> 00:05:33,080
I… I just saw it and…

58
00:05:33,680 --> 00:05:36,480
And you decided to pass the magic along?

59
00:05:42,000 --> 00:05:43,200
Such a coincidence?

60
00:05:45,040 --> 00:05:45,880
Yes, really.

61
00:06:34,560 --> 00:06:35,600
Thank you.

62
00:06:38,400 --> 00:06:39,840
I really like…

63
00:06:42,360 --> 00:06:45,520
your little "piggyback" gift.

64
00:06:55,760 --> 00:06:59,040
I've always felt like
a passerby in this city.

65
00:06:59,680 --> 00:07:01,920
My biggest dream was just

66
00:07:02,440 --> 00:07:04,680
an old apartment with 40 years of history.

67
00:07:06,680 --> 00:07:07,680
I never thought

68
00:07:09,320 --> 00:07:12,720
a piece of that brilliance
could actually belong to me.

69
00:07:18,360 --> 00:07:19,200
And me.

70
00:07:21,040 --> 00:07:22,480
I belong to you too.

71
00:08:11,720 --> 00:08:12,840
2024 BOLO CULTURE
ANNUAL FILM & TV ADAPTATION IP SLATE

72
00:08:12,920 --> 00:08:14,280
<i>NO ONE APPLAUDS</i>

73
00:08:24,880 --> 00:08:26,440
You saw all that?

74
00:08:28,080 --> 00:08:28,960
Saw what?

75
00:08:30,800 --> 00:08:31,920
Drop the act.

76
00:08:32,000 --> 00:08:34,080
I saw you replying in the group chat.

77
00:08:35,600 --> 00:08:36,840
Quick question.

78
00:08:36,919 --> 00:08:38,720
How does it feel
seeing your former subordinate

79
00:08:38,799 --> 00:08:39,679
doing so well now?

80
00:08:40,320 --> 00:08:42,200
However you're feeling right now,
that's how I'm feeling.

81
00:08:43,720 --> 00:08:44,960
Look at her.

82
00:08:45,040 --> 00:08:45,880
She's suspended pending investigation,

83
00:08:45,960 --> 00:08:47,800
and she still pulled off
a hundred-million-yuan deal.

84
00:08:47,880 --> 00:08:48,720
You're really not jealous?

85
00:08:50,880 --> 00:08:52,560
No. I'm just envious.

86
00:08:54,120 --> 00:08:56,400
People go through ups and downs.

87
00:08:56,480 --> 00:08:59,320
No need to get all worked up
over winning or losing one round.

88
00:09:00,440 --> 00:09:03,120
So whether it's Xu Chi
landing a huge investment banking deal

89
00:09:03,200 --> 00:09:06,720
or you making the Bolo Culture project
such a success for me,

90
00:09:06,800 --> 00:09:09,120
I just feel envious and happy for you.

91
00:09:10,280 --> 00:09:11,440
But what if you're really just

92
00:09:11,520 --> 00:09:13,480
a runner-up for life
and never get a medal?

93
00:09:15,960 --> 00:09:18,880
You've always been a wallflower
at the consulting association's mixers,

94
00:09:18,960 --> 00:09:20,080
but you still sign up every year.

95
00:09:24,800 --> 00:09:25,960
I really don't like you.

96
00:09:26,480 --> 00:09:28,520
But I really do like you.

97
00:09:29,040 --> 00:09:30,880
Even though you know
you can never win an argument with me,

98
00:09:30,960 --> 00:09:32,160
you keep coming back for more.

99
00:09:33,760 --> 00:09:35,000
I won't hold it against you.

100
00:09:35,920 --> 00:09:37,400
You're my team member, you know.

101
00:09:51,840 --> 00:09:53,000
Mr. Shen?

102
00:09:53,640 --> 00:09:55,000
What are you doing here?

103
00:09:55,080 --> 00:09:56,720
I take a nap here every day at noon.

104
00:09:56,800 --> 00:09:59,120
- Are you okay? Come on.
- I… I think I threw

105
00:09:59,200 --> 00:10:01,040
- my back out.
- Easy now.

106
00:10:01,120 --> 00:10:02,200
Come on.

107
00:10:03,240 --> 00:10:04,280
Easy.

108
00:10:05,320 --> 00:10:06,960
- How did my back suddenly just…
- Careful.

109
00:10:07,480 --> 00:10:10,120
This way. Left. Come sit. Sit.

110
00:10:10,640 --> 00:10:11,560
I'll go slow.

111
00:10:12,120 --> 00:10:14,120
- Sit down slowly.
- I'm going slow.

112
00:10:18,320 --> 00:10:19,640
Your back… Is your neck okay?

113
00:10:19,720 --> 00:10:21,840
- My neck's fine. It's my back.
- Your back.

114
00:10:23,680 --> 00:10:24,520
Here, hold this.

115
00:10:25,720 --> 00:10:27,080
- Right here?
- Yeah.

116
00:10:33,880 --> 00:10:34,760
My back hurts,

117
00:10:34,840 --> 00:10:36,560
but how come I feel so much better
when you press my knee?

118
00:10:38,200 --> 00:10:39,280
It's called the Weizhong acupoint.

119
00:10:39,360 --> 00:10:40,840
I used to get back pain all the time
when I was pregnant.

120
00:10:40,920 --> 00:10:42,120
Xu Chi taught me.

121
00:10:44,720 --> 00:10:46,640
- Take it easy.
- Weizhong acupoint?

122
00:10:47,680 --> 00:10:51,000
Xu… Xu Chi?

123
00:10:54,280 --> 00:10:56,400
You're not bothered by Xu Chi anymore?

124
00:10:57,960 --> 00:10:59,040
Bothered by what?

125
00:10:59,800 --> 00:11:01,160
Hey, come on.

126
00:11:01,240 --> 00:11:04,080
I heard what you said to Cindy earlier.

127
00:11:04,600 --> 00:11:06,400
Xu Chi is doing better than you now.

128
00:11:07,120 --> 00:11:08,440
You really are okay with it?

129
00:11:11,440 --> 00:11:13,560
Mr. Shen, this has
nothing to do with work.

130
00:11:13,640 --> 00:11:14,600
Can I not answer?

131
00:11:14,680 --> 00:11:16,800
Come on, don't play dumb with me.

132
00:11:17,400 --> 00:11:19,000
Nobody knows all the history
between you and Xu Chi

133
00:11:19,080 --> 00:11:20,480
better than I do.

134
00:11:20,560 --> 00:11:23,480
Spill it.
Where's your little drama at now?

135
00:11:27,680 --> 00:11:29,560
It'd be a lie to say
I don't feel anything at all.

136
00:11:29,640 --> 00:11:31,040
True.

137
00:11:31,120 --> 00:11:32,600
Xu Chi and I used to have our issues.

138
00:11:33,200 --> 00:11:36,800
But when it came to my divorce,
she really helped me out a lot.

139
00:11:36,880 --> 00:11:41,280
If I were still jealous of her,
I'd be a real piece of work.

140
00:11:41,360 --> 00:11:45,200
So now I just envy her and wish her well.

141
00:11:45,280 --> 00:11:46,920
I'm even trying to help her.

142
00:11:47,440 --> 00:11:50,360
Because a girl as capable as she is

143
00:11:50,440 --> 00:11:54,280
shouldn't get dragged into
some ridiculous commercial bribery case.

144
00:11:56,360 --> 00:11:57,920
So you two swapped roles now?

145
00:11:58,000 --> 00:12:00,680
You're the Sun Wukong now,
pulling 72 tricks on me?

146
00:12:01,480 --> 00:12:02,320
Mr. Shen,

147
00:12:02,400 --> 00:12:05,080
if there's nothing else, I'll get going.

148
00:12:05,160 --> 00:12:07,120
- Sorry for interrupting your nap.
- Wait…

149
00:12:09,280 --> 00:12:10,880
Take it slow. Slow down.

150
00:12:12,480 --> 00:12:14,760
Alright then. Let me treat you to a meal.

151
00:12:14,840 --> 00:12:17,240
Think of it
as a thank-you for fixing my back.

152
00:12:18,000 --> 00:12:20,920
No need. I already ate.

153
00:12:24,600 --> 00:12:27,200
Ate what? That sandwich
you picked up off the floor?

154
00:12:28,880 --> 00:12:29,920
I'm really not hungry.

155
00:12:32,440 --> 00:12:35,320
This is an order.
Now come have lunch with me.

156
00:12:36,720 --> 00:12:38,520
Don't forget, I'm the client.

157
00:12:50,320 --> 00:12:52,240
The steak is amazing.
Why aren't you eating?

158
00:12:52,320 --> 00:12:54,160
You need to eat more to put on weight.

159
00:12:56,600 --> 00:12:59,120
You ordered this. I don't eat red meat,
and I don't want to gain weight.

160
00:12:59,200 --> 00:13:01,360
If you like it, just have more.

161
00:13:01,440 --> 00:13:03,560
Oh, please. You don't eat red meat?

162
00:13:03,640 --> 00:13:05,560
You had so many photos of eating steak.

163
00:13:05,640 --> 00:13:07,120
I've seen them all.

164
00:13:07,880 --> 00:13:10,040
You're thin as a rail. Stop dieting.

165
00:13:12,080 --> 00:13:13,960
Okay. Stop checking your Moments.

166
00:13:14,040 --> 00:13:15,520
You blocked me on Moments,

167
00:13:15,600 --> 00:13:17,200
but Cindy didn't.

168
00:13:17,280 --> 00:13:20,040
She posted a ton
of unflattering photos of you.

169
00:13:20,120 --> 00:13:21,640
Some make you look really heavy and messy.

170
00:13:26,640 --> 00:13:27,560
There you go.

171
00:13:28,480 --> 00:13:30,080
Eat more so you can put on some weight.

172
00:13:30,160 --> 00:13:32,080
Putting on weight
boosts your immune system.

173
00:13:32,160 --> 00:13:35,520
That way, when you and Cindy go at it,
you'll be in a better mood.

174
00:13:41,720 --> 00:13:44,280
Sorry. Did I say something wrong again?

175
00:13:46,160 --> 00:13:47,840
But honestly,

176
00:13:48,680 --> 00:13:51,320
when you and Cindy fight,
it's like Tom and Jerry.

177
00:13:51,920 --> 00:13:53,080
It's actually pretty funny.

178
00:13:53,160 --> 00:13:55,840
Whenever I'm tired from work,
I get a kick out of watching you two.

179
00:13:57,440 --> 00:13:59,560
You really have a way with words.

180
00:13:59,640 --> 00:14:01,440
Believe me, next year this day
will be your death anniversary.

181
00:14:04,680 --> 00:14:05,760
Okay.

182
00:14:06,280 --> 00:14:09,720
Then mark my words, next year this day
will be our wedding anniversary.

183
00:14:14,000 --> 00:14:14,920
Think you can beat me?

184
00:14:22,000 --> 00:14:22,920
Where are you going?

185
00:14:31,720 --> 00:14:32,680
Lin Long.

186
00:14:33,600 --> 00:14:35,680
Be careful. Are you okay?

187
00:14:38,560 --> 00:14:40,440
Put your phones away! Stop filming!

188
00:14:40,520 --> 00:14:42,120
Never seen an old lady
with bad legs before?

189
00:14:43,440 --> 00:14:45,120
- Are you okay?
- Stay away from me.

190
00:14:46,520 --> 00:14:49,080
I was just joking.
Why did you take it seriously?

191
00:14:49,160 --> 00:14:51,640
- I just don't have a filter--
- That's enough!

192
00:14:52,160 --> 00:14:54,080
Still, that doesn't give you
the right to push people around.

193
00:14:54,600 --> 00:14:56,440
You think just because you're the client,
you can pick on me like this?

194
00:14:56,520 --> 00:14:58,040
Let me tell you, I've had enough of this!

195
00:14:59,800 --> 00:15:01,720
Who's picking on you?

196
00:15:08,000 --> 00:15:09,960
Lin Long. Lin Long.

197
00:15:12,600 --> 00:15:13,720
I know you're furious.

198
00:15:14,560 --> 00:15:15,840
Come on, I'll give you a chance.

199
00:15:16,800 --> 00:15:17,840
Come at me.

200
00:15:22,920 --> 00:15:26,080
Take it out on me. Come on.

201
00:15:26,800 --> 00:15:27,960
What's your problem?

202
00:15:28,920 --> 00:15:31,480
You're the one with the problem.
I'm trying to fix you.

203
00:15:32,640 --> 00:15:34,160
A shrink is expensive and useless.

204
00:15:34,240 --> 00:15:36,000
Nothing works better
than throwing punches at me.

205
00:15:37,240 --> 00:15:40,480
From what I've seen,
you've been living like a robot lately.

206
00:15:41,080 --> 00:15:43,400
It was like that outside the bathroom
that day, and it's the same today.

207
00:15:44,040 --> 00:15:45,760
Okay. I'll give you a chance.

208
00:15:45,840 --> 00:15:47,720
Just take it out on me.

209
00:15:48,440 --> 00:15:49,280
Come on.

210
00:15:50,600 --> 00:15:52,120
- You mean it?
- Yeah, hit me.

211
00:15:52,760 --> 00:15:56,320
Your client now wants you to throw
a few heavy punches at him.

212
00:15:56,400 --> 00:15:57,400
Come on.

213
00:15:59,880 --> 00:16:00,920
Don't laugh. I actually learned this.

214
00:16:01,920 --> 00:16:03,200
Like anyone hasn't trained.

215
00:16:03,280 --> 00:16:04,240
Come on.

216
00:16:09,880 --> 00:16:11,720
Be water, my friend.

217
00:16:12,440 --> 00:16:13,520
‪Make your move.

218
00:16:15,240 --> 00:16:17,120
Hold on. Let me get my nunchucks.

219
00:16:18,720 --> 00:16:21,720
Forgot to bring them today.
I'll just use air as nunchucks. Come on.

220
00:16:24,760 --> 00:16:25,800
What's wrong?

221
00:16:26,720 --> 00:16:27,640
Wait.

222
00:16:28,280 --> 00:16:30,960
Well… Bruce Lee's back
doesn't seem to be working too well.

223
00:16:31,040 --> 00:16:33,760
- My back's acting up again.
- Go over there.

224
00:16:34,400 --> 00:16:35,280
- Go.
- Wait. Slow down.

225
00:16:36,440 --> 00:16:38,520
Oh my God. Easy. Look at you…

226
00:16:38,600 --> 00:16:40,800
Why are you trying to act tough?

227
00:16:41,320 --> 00:16:42,160
Oh man.

228
00:16:47,920 --> 00:16:49,520
Easy, easy.

229
00:16:51,800 --> 00:16:52,800
No laughing.

230
00:16:53,400 --> 00:16:54,840
Why can't I laugh?

231
00:16:57,720 --> 00:16:59,440
Fine, laugh all you want.

232
00:17:03,880 --> 00:17:05,079
Mr. Shen, do you have feelings for me?

233
00:17:08,880 --> 00:17:11,040
When I was pregnant,
you took me to the hospital

234
00:17:11,119 --> 00:17:12,760
and got me that amulet.

235
00:17:12,839 --> 00:17:14,720
And now on this project,
you're always looking out for me.

236
00:17:15,319 --> 00:17:17,359
You care about my health,
my eating habits,

237
00:17:17,440 --> 00:17:19,800
and you let me hit you and yell at you.
Is all of this just to make me happy?

238
00:17:21,280 --> 00:17:23,560
I… I don't. Don't be ridiculous.

239
00:17:26,680 --> 00:17:30,280
You love to tease me,
and you're trying to get close to me.

240
00:17:30,360 --> 00:17:32,840
Is this your way of getting my attention?

241
00:17:32,920 --> 00:17:34,440
No. I…

242
00:17:35,680 --> 00:17:38,280
I… I… At most, it's just…

243
00:17:38,360 --> 00:17:39,640
It's just sympathy.

244
00:17:40,400 --> 00:17:43,080
I just want our project to go smoothly.

245
00:17:43,160 --> 00:17:44,160
Don't…

246
00:17:52,680 --> 00:17:53,680
Hello.

247
00:17:55,760 --> 00:17:57,440
Yes. Okay, okay.

248
00:17:57,960 --> 00:17:59,240
Alright, bye.

249
00:18:01,040 --> 00:18:02,240
Uh,

250
00:18:02,320 --> 00:18:04,920
the bank suddenly needs me for something.
I should go.

251
00:18:05,440 --> 00:18:07,200
I… I won't be able
to drive you home today.

252
00:18:07,280 --> 00:18:08,880
- See you around.
- Okay.

253
00:18:26,200 --> 00:18:27,040
Why are you here?

254
00:18:27,120 --> 00:18:29,480
You've been off the grid.
Your phone's been off too.

255
00:18:30,000 --> 00:18:32,840
I remembered you live nearby,
and you said you like Benbang noodles.

256
00:18:32,920 --> 00:18:36,000
I searched all over a food app.
Finally found the place.

257
00:18:36,080 --> 00:18:37,320
What?

258
00:18:37,400 --> 00:18:39,720
You escaped your misery,
went to a new company to live it up,

259
00:18:39,800 --> 00:18:41,320
and now you're here to show off?

260
00:18:46,200 --> 00:18:48,840
I just found out
you told the investigation team

261
00:18:48,920 --> 00:18:51,800
that the plan to make Celestial redo
their microservices architecture

262
00:18:51,880 --> 00:18:54,920
was something we did together
under Ma Ke's orders.

263
00:18:55,000 --> 00:18:56,120
Why did you set me up?

264
00:18:56,200 --> 00:18:59,280
You know I was against that plan.
I tried to change it more than once.

265
00:19:01,760 --> 00:19:02,760
Trying to trap me?

266
00:19:03,880 --> 00:19:05,000
Dare you unlock it?

267
00:19:19,480 --> 00:19:20,400
Explain it.

268
00:19:20,480 --> 00:19:22,480
You broke up with me.

269
00:19:22,560 --> 00:19:24,560
You said we should part on good terms.

270
00:19:24,640 --> 00:19:27,120
So why did you lie
to the investigation team

271
00:19:27,200 --> 00:19:28,480
and drag me into this mess?

272
00:19:30,520 --> 00:19:33,200
Yang Rui. What did I ever do to you?

273
00:19:34,480 --> 00:19:35,760
You did do me wrong.

274
00:19:35,840 --> 00:19:37,160
Did you ever really like me?

275
00:19:37,240 --> 00:19:38,520
Your heart always belonged
to someone else.

276
00:19:38,600 --> 00:19:39,880
What did I do wrong?

277
00:19:39,960 --> 00:19:41,600
I just listened to Ma Ke.

278
00:19:41,680 --> 00:19:44,240
Maxmise has such a high turnover rate.
What's wrong with clinging to my leader?

279
00:19:44,320 --> 00:19:47,320
I didn't take a single cent from this,
but they don't believe me!

280
00:19:47,400 --> 00:19:49,280
They have his transfer records to me,
so they're saying I took bribes.

281
00:19:49,360 --> 00:19:51,760
Then show them the chat logs
and flight info.

282
00:19:51,840 --> 00:19:53,560
I did. It didn't work.

283
00:19:53,640 --> 00:19:57,160
But I fronted too much money for Ma Ke.
There's no way to sort it all out.

284
00:19:57,240 --> 00:19:58,280
I asked Ma Ke to testify,

285
00:19:58,360 --> 00:20:01,240
but he threatened me
and asked me to drag you into it.

286
00:20:01,840 --> 00:20:03,800
Because your boyfriend
is a partner at Hezong.

287
00:20:04,400 --> 00:20:07,320
If he's willing to cover for you,
we still have a way out.

288
00:20:08,480 --> 00:20:09,840
I know it's despicable,

289
00:20:10,360 --> 00:20:12,200
but it wasn't easy
for me to get into Maxmise.

290
00:20:12,280 --> 00:20:13,560
I have a mortgage
and a car loan to pay off.

291
00:20:13,640 --> 00:20:15,040
And I want to make partner someday.

292
00:20:17,640 --> 00:20:19,160
I don't want to lose this one chance.

293
00:20:19,840 --> 00:20:20,880
Yang Rui.

294
00:20:21,520 --> 00:20:23,280
Let's figure this out together, alright?

295
00:20:25,000 --> 00:20:26,240
It's no use.

296
00:20:26,320 --> 00:20:28,120
The company doesn't trust me anymore.

297
00:20:29,760 --> 00:20:31,360
Otherwise, they wouldn't have
kept me suspended for this long.

298
00:20:34,760 --> 00:20:35,880
Can you help me, Xu Chi?

299
00:20:37,440 --> 00:20:39,120
Get your boyfriend to step in

300
00:20:39,720 --> 00:20:42,400
and let me stay at Maxmise.
I'll do anything.

301
00:20:48,800 --> 00:20:51,400
<i>But I fronted too much money for Ma Ke.</i>
<i>There's no way to sort it all out.</i>

302
00:20:51,480 --> 00:20:52,320
RECORDING

303
00:20:52,400 --> 00:20:55,000
<i>I asked Ma Ke to testify,</i>
<i>but he threatened me</i>

304
00:20:55,080 --> 00:20:56,560
<i>and asked me to drag you into it.</i>

305
00:20:59,800 --> 00:21:02,640
This recording should prove
I'm innocent, right?

306
00:21:02,720 --> 00:21:05,560
It's a good start. But it's not enough.

307
00:21:07,160 --> 00:21:08,800
The investigation team might think

308
00:21:08,880 --> 00:21:11,440
Yang Rui only said those things
to clear your name.

309
00:21:13,400 --> 00:21:14,800
Fair point.

310
00:21:14,880 --> 00:21:17,080
I'll also need physical evidence.

311
00:21:17,680 --> 00:21:19,200
You've made a lot of progress.

312
00:21:19,280 --> 00:21:21,440
At least you're trying
to save yourself now.

313
00:21:22,200 --> 00:21:23,920
With something this complicated,

314
00:21:24,000 --> 00:21:26,600
you can't rely on the company
to figure it out on their own.

315
00:21:26,680 --> 00:21:28,520
Drag it out too long, and you're done for.

316
00:21:29,360 --> 00:21:30,200
Sha.

317
00:21:31,120 --> 00:21:32,960
You got Lin to pass along
what Yang Rui told

318
00:21:33,040 --> 00:21:35,240
the investigation team to me, right?

319
00:21:36,920 --> 00:21:38,040
You figured it out.

320
00:21:39,120 --> 00:21:40,280
Why are you helping me?

321
00:21:40,800 --> 00:21:42,720
You don't blame me
for dragging you into this?

322
00:21:42,800 --> 00:21:45,240
After all, it was because I wanted
to transfer to digital finance that…

323
00:21:45,320 --> 00:21:47,040
Why does there have to be a reason?

324
00:21:47,560 --> 00:21:48,800
You're my subordinate.

325
00:21:49,680 --> 00:21:51,520
You got framed just like I did.

326
00:21:51,600 --> 00:21:53,640
Of course, I'd help you.

327
00:21:54,880 --> 00:21:55,720
Besides,

328
00:21:55,800 --> 00:21:58,720
if you can get out of this,
it benefits me too.

329
00:21:59,640 --> 00:22:03,120
For one, Bu Tianna
will stop camping outside my door.

330
00:22:03,200 --> 00:22:05,120
And Richard will owe me a favor.

331
00:22:06,600 --> 00:22:10,840
But more than that, I want you to know
that in this company, in this industry,

332
00:22:10,920 --> 00:22:13,640
not every leader
steps on their subordinates

333
00:22:13,720 --> 00:22:14,600
to get ahead like Ma Ke.

334
00:22:18,400 --> 00:22:19,440
Thank you, Sha.

335
00:22:20,680 --> 00:22:22,800
Alright. Go find the people at Celestial.

336
00:22:27,960 --> 00:22:29,040
Sha.

337
00:22:29,800 --> 00:22:31,240
I've actually been thinking.

338
00:22:33,800 --> 00:22:37,880
Has Ma Ke still not admitted
he took money from Director Peng?

339
00:22:40,480 --> 00:22:41,400
No.

340
00:22:41,920 --> 00:22:44,880
He only admitted to taking the request

341
00:22:44,960 --> 00:22:47,920
and suggesting
an outsourcing company in the proposal.

342
00:22:48,440 --> 00:22:49,520
He never confessed to taking bribes.

343
00:22:49,600 --> 00:22:51,280
But Peng insists

344
00:22:51,360 --> 00:22:53,400
he personally gave Ma Ke
two million in cash.

345
00:22:53,480 --> 00:22:54,760
There's a time, a place, and witnesses.

346
00:22:54,840 --> 00:22:56,720
Two million in cash?

347
00:22:58,000 --> 00:22:59,560
So no transfer records?

348
00:23:03,280 --> 00:23:05,760
If Ma Ke had finished
the Celestial project,

349
00:23:05,840 --> 00:23:07,640
he'd be promoted
to associate partner, right?

350
00:23:08,440 --> 00:23:10,320
Would he really gamble
his whole career away?

351
00:23:11,320 --> 00:23:14,360
Is it possible
he really didn't take the money?

352
00:23:14,960 --> 00:23:18,000
The company did check his credit records.
Everything was normal.

353
00:23:18,920 --> 00:23:20,840
Can you arrange for me to talk to him?

354
00:23:20,920 --> 00:23:22,760
If we can prove he didn't take the money,
this whole thing is over.

355
00:23:24,040 --> 00:23:25,880
- You really want to do this?
- Is there a problem?

356
00:23:27,000 --> 00:23:31,080
If you speak up for him now,
you could get pulled in even deeper.

357
00:23:31,160 --> 00:23:34,040
You could've used this recording
to clear your name.

358
00:23:34,120 --> 00:23:35,720
Why wade into this mess?

359
00:23:35,800 --> 00:23:38,160
Because the higher-ups
have already decided that whether

360
00:23:38,240 --> 00:23:40,360
Ma Ke took the money or not, he is out.

361
00:23:42,080 --> 00:23:43,360
Even so,

362
00:23:43,880 --> 00:23:47,520
being fired for bribery
and resigning over policy violations

363
00:23:47,600 --> 00:23:48,440
aren't the same thing.

364
00:23:50,080 --> 00:23:52,200
I do have a history with Ma Ke.

365
00:23:52,280 --> 00:23:54,480
I really have no reason to help him.

366
00:23:54,560 --> 00:23:57,960
But what you just said gave me an idea.

367
00:23:58,480 --> 00:23:59,480
I want to do something.

368
00:24:00,120 --> 00:24:02,600
To prove I can clear my name
without relying on connections.

369
00:24:02,680 --> 00:24:07,520
To prove I'm not like Yang Rui,
who drags others down with him.

370
00:24:22,600 --> 00:24:23,920
When are you going to see Ma Ke?

371
00:24:25,280 --> 00:24:27,320
How do you know Sha agreed?

372
00:24:27,400 --> 00:24:29,040
Sha's smart.

373
00:24:29,920 --> 00:24:31,560
She set up the meeting with Ma Ke.

374
00:24:32,600 --> 00:24:35,640
If nothing comes out of it,
it doesn't hurt her personally.

375
00:24:35,720 --> 00:24:37,520
If something does,

376
00:24:37,600 --> 00:24:40,240
you and she become the heroes
who saved Maxmise's reputation.

377
00:24:45,000 --> 00:24:47,280
Actually, I'm kind of scared now. What if…

378
00:24:47,360 --> 00:24:49,400
What if Ma Ke really did take the money,

379
00:24:49,480 --> 00:24:51,840
and I really do get pulled in deeper
like Sha said?

380
00:24:53,840 --> 00:24:54,960
Hands off your head.

381
00:24:58,600 --> 00:25:00,840
Cross your arms in front of your chest.

382
00:25:02,640 --> 00:25:03,800
- Like this?
- Yeah. A bit lower.

383
00:25:03,880 --> 00:25:04,920
Not that high.

384
00:25:05,640 --> 00:25:07,240
- Like this?
- Yeah, that's good.

385
00:25:08,880 --> 00:25:11,600
Let's have dinner tonight.
I want to introduce you to a friend.

386
00:25:12,600 --> 00:25:13,520
A friend?

387
00:25:14,040 --> 00:25:15,840
- A guy or a girl?
- A girl.

388
00:25:15,920 --> 00:25:17,200
A girl?

389
00:25:19,320 --> 00:25:21,440
You know Jun'an, right?
One of the top Red Circle Law Firms.

390
00:25:21,520 --> 00:25:23,240
There's this legendary lawyer, Bai Xiao.

391
00:25:23,760 --> 00:25:25,920
She has handled
a lot of commercial bribery cases.

392
00:25:26,000 --> 00:25:28,040
If you have a lawyer with you
when you meet Ma Ke,

393
00:25:28,120 --> 00:25:29,240
it should save you a lot of trouble.

394
00:25:36,840 --> 00:25:37,760
You did that on purpose.

395
00:25:39,440 --> 00:25:41,640
I just wanted to mess with you.

396
00:25:55,920 --> 00:25:58,960
Now this is messing with you.

397
00:26:11,360 --> 00:26:12,960
Cutie.

398
00:26:15,800 --> 00:26:17,160
Ye Xinzhi!

399
00:26:19,240 --> 00:26:20,960
Come on. Time to cool down.

400
00:26:21,040 --> 00:26:22,200
- Let's stretch.
- You do it.

401
00:26:22,280 --> 00:26:23,520
- Come on, stretch.
- Me?

402
00:26:23,600 --> 00:26:24,720
Me?

403
00:26:24,800 --> 00:26:26,120
No. I just finished.

404
00:26:26,200 --> 00:26:27,360
I just finished my set.

405
00:26:27,440 --> 00:26:28,960
So gross and mushy.

406
00:26:29,040 --> 00:26:31,320
I seriously can't stand you guys
being so lovey-dovey.

407
00:26:31,400 --> 00:26:32,880
Spare me the details next time. Thanks.

408
00:26:33,400 --> 00:26:34,440
No, don't you…

409
00:26:34,520 --> 00:26:37,600
Don't you think he's so charming?

410
00:26:38,720 --> 00:26:39,960
Charming?

411
00:26:40,040 --> 00:26:40,880
I mean…

412
00:26:44,840 --> 00:26:45,960
Nice weather today, huh.

413
00:26:49,000 --> 00:26:50,840
Thanks a lot. It's raining today.

414
00:26:52,160 --> 00:26:55,640
I really can't talk
to you women when you're in love.

415
00:26:56,160 --> 00:26:57,480
Aren't you in love?

416
00:26:59,720 --> 00:27:00,760
No, I'm not.

417
00:27:06,800 --> 00:27:08,320
You and Zhao Heng

418
00:27:08,400 --> 00:27:11,640
- are just colleagues who eat together.
- Colleagues.

419
00:27:11,720 --> 00:27:13,120
Right, colleagues.

420
00:27:13,200 --> 00:27:15,000
What's wrong with colleagues
eating together?

421
00:27:15,080 --> 00:27:16,240
Nothing.

422
00:27:16,320 --> 00:27:18,040
But going home together after dinner?
That's something.

423
00:27:27,800 --> 00:27:28,720
Sha.

424
00:27:30,840 --> 00:27:31,920
Hey, Sha.

425
00:27:32,000 --> 00:27:34,040
I'm ready. I can head over anytime.

426
00:27:40,240 --> 00:27:41,560
I… I didn't mean it like that.

427
00:27:41,640 --> 00:27:42,920
Can you help me talk to him?

428
00:27:43,520 --> 00:27:45,920
Or a video call? Would a video call work?

429
00:27:52,960 --> 00:27:54,560
Alright, I got it.

430
00:27:56,720 --> 00:27:57,640
Okay. Thanks.

431
00:27:59,560 --> 00:28:00,600
What's wrong?

432
00:28:02,160 --> 00:28:03,320
Ma Ke refused to see me.

433
00:28:07,960 --> 00:28:10,600
- Why?
- I don't know.

434
00:28:10,680 --> 00:28:14,960
Sha just said Ma Ke refused
when he heard I was bringing a lawyer.

435
00:28:15,040 --> 00:28:15,920
He said I'm the last person

436
00:28:16,000 --> 00:28:17,440
in the whole company
he wants to see right now.

437
00:28:21,240 --> 00:28:22,160
It's fine.

438
00:28:22,680 --> 00:28:24,560
Not seeing him doesn't cost me anything.

439
00:28:25,280 --> 00:28:27,440
I already met with Ms. Yu
from Celestial this morning.

440
00:28:28,040 --> 00:28:31,880
She's pretty willing to help me.
You think I should get her a gift?

441
00:28:31,960 --> 00:28:33,040
Is it appropriate?

442
00:28:34,640 --> 00:28:36,320
Let's build a model and analyze it.

443
00:28:37,520 --> 00:28:39,560
No need. I'm just giving a gift.

444
00:28:39,640 --> 00:28:41,720
Do we really need
a consulting model for that?

445
00:28:41,800 --> 00:28:44,440
It's not about the gift.
It's about why Ma Ke is dodging you.

446
00:28:45,160 --> 00:28:46,280
You changed the subject,

447
00:28:46,360 --> 00:28:49,320
but I can tell you're still not over it.

448
00:28:50,520 --> 00:28:51,600
EXPECTATION

449
00:28:51,680 --> 00:28:53,040
Three major problem models.

450
00:28:53,560 --> 00:28:55,960
Which one does Ma Ke's refusal
to see you fall under?

451
00:28:56,040 --> 00:28:59,840
A gap between expectation and reality.
So it's a restoration-type problem.

452
00:29:00,440 --> 00:29:01,920
But we really don't need to analyze it.

453
00:29:02,000 --> 00:29:06,080
Sure, I'm a little sore about it,
but I'll sleep it off. Really.

454
00:29:06,160 --> 00:29:09,000
Will sleep really pull out
that thorn in your side?

455
00:29:11,040 --> 00:29:13,400
Smart people always have
one thing in common.

456
00:29:13,480 --> 00:29:14,760
They're not great at facing failure.

457
00:29:14,840 --> 00:29:17,400
When they hit a setback,
they either shut down

458
00:29:17,480 --> 00:29:19,040
or have a total meltdown.

459
00:29:19,560 --> 00:29:21,160
So, my brilliant girlfriend,

460
00:29:21,240 --> 00:29:25,120
will you let me give you
a consultant crash course today?

461
00:29:27,920 --> 00:29:28,960
Okay.

462
00:29:29,760 --> 00:29:34,160
Now we know what type of problem this is.
So what do we do next?

463
00:29:34,240 --> 00:29:37,200
Analyze the root cause
behind the phenomenon.

464
00:29:39,840 --> 00:29:42,760
There are about three directions.

465
00:29:43,520 --> 00:29:44,360
One,

466
00:29:44,440 --> 00:29:47,520
Ma Ke just hates me

467
00:29:47,600 --> 00:29:49,080
because of our past.

468
00:29:49,160 --> 00:29:53,040
Two, he's wary of lawyers,
so he's resistant.

469
00:30:09,760 --> 00:30:10,640
So what's the conclusion?

470
00:30:12,680 --> 00:30:15,160
The investigation team is strict,

471
00:30:15,240 --> 00:30:18,600
so Ma Ke has deep hostility
toward both Maxmise and me.

472
00:30:18,680 --> 00:30:20,200
If I want to achieve my original goal,

473
00:30:20,280 --> 00:30:22,520
I need to find a way to see him
without a lawyer.

474
00:30:22,600 --> 00:30:23,680
But that's not hard.

475
00:30:23,760 --> 00:30:26,000
I've sent him packages before,
so I have his home address.

476
00:30:26,520 --> 00:30:28,520
Wear the bracelet and bring pepper spray.

477
00:30:28,600 --> 00:30:31,000
Just like with Yang Rui.
Better safe than sorry.

478
00:30:35,000 --> 00:30:38,880
Do you think it's shady that I secretly
recorded with the bracelet?

479
00:30:39,800 --> 00:30:41,880
- No.
- Then would you laugh at me?

480
00:30:42,400 --> 00:30:43,560
Because I was set up by my ex-boyfriend.

481
00:30:45,000 --> 00:30:46,200
Of course not.

482
00:30:46,280 --> 00:30:48,080
Without him, how would I look so good?

483
00:30:53,240 --> 00:30:54,240
You still want to help him, right?

484
00:30:57,480 --> 00:31:00,960
I always remember how he helped me
when I first joined Maxmise.

485
00:31:02,080 --> 00:31:03,720
I actually don't think he's a bad guy.

486
00:31:04,360 --> 00:31:06,080
He was just forced into a corner.

487
00:31:09,480 --> 00:31:11,160
He probably didn't say anything serious.

488
00:31:11,680 --> 00:31:14,280
Otherwise, you wouldn't have
had such an easy time

489
00:31:14,360 --> 00:31:15,520
during your leave.

490
00:31:16,360 --> 00:31:17,800
The investigation team
would've been all over you.

491
00:31:23,520 --> 00:31:25,960
You're actually speaking up
for your love rival?

492
00:31:26,040 --> 00:31:28,400
You think he's worthy
of being my love rival?

493
00:31:30,720 --> 00:31:33,600
Honestly, you and Tianna belong together.

494
00:31:33,680 --> 00:31:36,160
- You're both so full of yourselves.
- Whoa, hold on.

495
00:31:36,240 --> 00:31:39,520
I can't take that.
That's way too rich for me.

496
00:31:39,600 --> 00:31:41,720
I'd rather stick
to something plain and simple.

497
00:31:42,720 --> 00:31:44,360
Plain and simple?

498
00:31:44,880 --> 00:31:46,200
- Wait… Stop.
- I'm "plain and simple"?

499
00:31:46,280 --> 00:31:49,040
My bad. My bad. Back to business.

500
00:31:49,120 --> 00:31:50,040
I give up.

501
00:31:51,200 --> 00:31:52,080
Good.

502
00:31:53,600 --> 00:31:55,680
By the way, I saw you preparing for class.

503
00:31:55,760 --> 00:31:58,480
Why did you suddenly decide to be
a guest professor at a business school?

504
00:31:58,560 --> 00:32:00,560
The moment Morse's funding came in,

505
00:32:00,640 --> 00:32:02,720
Wen Ruosen started burning money
like crazy on promotion.

506
00:32:03,240 --> 00:32:04,680
The agreement terms are so harsh.

507
00:32:04,760 --> 00:32:06,800
Even if we don't push from behind,

508
00:32:07,400 --> 00:32:09,480
he'll be driven forward
by capital and greed.

509
00:32:09,560 --> 00:32:11,200
It's like playing Go.

510
00:32:11,280 --> 00:32:13,040
Once you secure your territory,
you start building momentum.

511
00:32:14,000 --> 00:32:16,160
I can't just wait for the digital
collectibles market to blow up on its own.

512
00:32:16,240 --> 00:32:18,840
Huanghe Business School
is a well-known think tank.

513
00:32:18,920 --> 00:32:23,120
If I can use my lectures
to let the people who get to shape policy

514
00:32:23,200 --> 00:32:25,960
know about systemic risks
in digital collectibles,

515
00:32:26,480 --> 00:32:27,520
then Wen Ruosen's done for.

516
00:32:29,040 --> 00:32:32,080
I really love this scheming side of you.

517
00:32:35,720 --> 00:32:38,320
Consulting is always about open strategy.

518
00:32:38,400 --> 00:32:39,400
Not scheming.

519
00:32:40,080 --> 00:32:42,200
I don't care. I love it anyway.

520
00:33:14,600 --> 00:33:15,840
Mr. Shen.

521
00:33:16,640 --> 00:33:17,840
LACTATION ROOM

522
00:33:17,920 --> 00:33:18,920
You're still at work.

523
00:33:19,000 --> 00:33:20,800
What a coincidence.
You're still at work too.

524
00:33:22,280 --> 00:33:24,560
Actually, I was just joking that day.

525
00:33:24,640 --> 00:33:28,360
You don't have to run scared
every time you see me.

526
00:33:29,040 --> 00:33:32,000
Should I take the day off
for the delivery meeting

527
00:33:32,080 --> 00:33:34,560
the day after tomorrow,
so you won't feel so awkward?

528
00:33:37,840 --> 00:33:38,680
Not awkward.

529
00:33:39,320 --> 00:33:42,240
I just forgot a file.
I came back to get it.

530
00:33:47,200 --> 00:33:48,760
This is your office?

531
00:33:49,560 --> 00:33:51,000
This is my new offi…

532
00:34:00,440 --> 00:34:04,080
Uh, it's my office during the day.
At night they

533
00:34:05,000 --> 00:34:07,360
use it as a lactation room.

534
00:34:09,719 --> 00:34:11,639
No… This isn't right.

535
00:34:11,719 --> 00:34:14,920
I used to be the one laughing at you.
How did the tables turn?

536
00:34:16,639 --> 00:34:19,520
Maybe before,
you always saw me at my worst.

537
00:34:20,600 --> 00:34:23,600
But now I've finally
pulled myself together.

538
00:34:25,040 --> 00:34:26,639
I… I… I wanted to ask you…

539
00:34:28,080 --> 00:34:30,159
You said all that to me that day.

540
00:34:31,560 --> 00:34:32,719
You don't have a crush on me, do you?

541
00:34:34,960 --> 00:34:36,280
Okay,

542
00:34:36,360 --> 00:34:38,719
stop. It's not gonna be anything good.

543
00:34:40,199 --> 00:34:45,080
I… I know myself pretty well.
I know I'm…

544
00:34:49,639 --> 00:34:53,120
Who were you on the phone with?
Not arguing with Cindy again, are you?

545
00:34:53,960 --> 00:34:54,800
It was Xu Chi.

546
00:34:54,880 --> 00:34:58,520
She wants to find a colleague
to prove her innocence.

547
00:34:58,600 --> 00:35:01,280
But this guy moved after being suspended.
No one can reach him.

548
00:35:03,320 --> 00:35:04,840
That's easy.

549
00:35:04,920 --> 00:35:07,360
Do you have his number?
I can track him down in no time.

550
00:35:08,520 --> 00:35:10,240
Invading personal privacy is illegal.

551
00:35:14,000 --> 00:35:15,600
What are you talking about?

552
00:35:16,120 --> 00:35:18,360
I used to work in network security.

553
00:35:18,440 --> 00:35:22,000
If I want to, I have
10,000 legal ways to hunt him down.

554
00:35:23,600 --> 00:35:25,440
Thanks, but no thanks.

555
00:35:27,040 --> 00:35:28,640
Trust me.

556
00:35:28,720 --> 00:35:30,240
How old is he? Married?

557
00:35:30,760 --> 00:35:32,600
About mid-30s. His kid's eight.

558
00:35:32,680 --> 00:35:35,640
Moving is easy,
but switching a kid's school is hard.

559
00:35:35,720 --> 00:35:37,160
As long as you know
where his kid goes to school,

560
00:35:37,240 --> 00:35:38,800
just wait at the school gate.

561
00:35:38,880 --> 00:35:41,240
He's a local, middle-aged, unemployed guy.

562
00:35:41,320 --> 00:35:42,760
His wife would definitely
make him pick up the kid.

563
00:35:44,720 --> 00:35:47,480
Don't rush me. I've been waiting two days.

564
00:35:48,000 --> 00:35:50,280
- Still haven't seen him.
- <i>But this afternoon at 5:30,</i>

565
00:35:50,360 --> 00:35:53,320
<i>Celestial and Maxmise are holding</i>
<i>a joint investigation briefing.</i>

566
00:35:53,400 --> 00:35:55,400
<i>If you can't get through</i>
<i>to Ma Ke before then,</i>

567
00:35:55,480 --> 00:35:56,840
<i>you might really be in trouble.</i>

568
00:35:56,920 --> 00:35:57,960
I know.

569
00:35:59,440 --> 00:36:00,440
Talk to you later.

570
00:36:00,520 --> 00:36:06,400
EXPERIMENTAL PRIMARY SCHOOL
EAST CAMPUS

571
00:36:08,600 --> 00:36:10,600
Ma Ke! Ma Ke!

572
00:36:13,320 --> 00:36:14,440
Sorry. I got the wrong person.

573
00:36:15,000 --> 00:36:16,480
- Sorry.
- It's fine.

574
00:36:17,480 --> 00:36:19,640
Chi! Found Ma Ke. Get in!

575
00:36:19,720 --> 00:36:20,600
Found him?

576
00:36:31,080 --> 00:36:32,560
Ma Ke's kid is sick.

577
00:36:32,640 --> 00:36:34,800
- He's been at the hospital.
- How did you find out?

578
00:36:35,400 --> 00:36:37,520
Du's team has a professional
business investigation team.

579
00:36:38,880 --> 00:36:39,720
Great.

580
00:36:44,120 --> 00:36:45,360
But what if

581
00:36:45,440 --> 00:36:47,680
he's upset about his kid's situation
and doesn't want to see me?

582
00:36:47,760 --> 00:36:50,800
The investigation briefing
is in an hour and a half.

583
00:36:51,320 --> 00:36:52,920
My fate is about to be sealed.

584
00:36:54,160 --> 00:36:56,680
Our fate is always in our own hands.

585
00:36:57,480 --> 00:36:59,640
Back when I was framed, I had no one.

586
00:36:59,720 --> 00:37:02,320
But you're different. You have me.

587
00:37:11,760 --> 00:37:14,120
The kid's already been admitted.
I'll talk to you later.

588
00:37:18,720 --> 00:37:19,680
Ma Ke!

589
00:37:20,800 --> 00:37:23,000
Don't you want to tell your kid
his dad was framed?

590
00:37:26,720 --> 00:37:27,920
Let me just say three things.

591
00:37:29,280 --> 00:37:31,720
First, I'm willing to believe
you didn't take Celestial's money.

592
00:37:32,480 --> 00:37:34,120
Second, I don't like you,

593
00:37:34,200 --> 00:37:36,000
but I really
want to help you and Yang Rui.

594
00:37:36,080 --> 00:37:37,560
Because only by proving
you didn't take bribes

595
00:37:37,640 --> 00:37:39,840
can I go back to Maxmise
with my head held high.

596
00:37:39,920 --> 00:37:43,400
Third, I found a way to see the mid-term
investigation report and found a problem.

597
00:37:43,480 --> 00:37:46,760
Peng from Celestial says
you two met many times to discuss things.

598
00:37:46,840 --> 00:37:50,360
One of those times was last month
on the 24th at 7:30 p.m. at Century Mall.

599
00:37:50,440 --> 00:37:51,800
But I checked your schedule.

600
00:37:51,880 --> 00:37:53,760
That night at 6:30,
you were still near the airport.

601
00:37:54,560 --> 00:37:57,160
With evening rush hour,
that's just impossible.

602
00:37:58,120 --> 00:37:59,960
Why would he lie about a detail like that?

603
00:38:02,680 --> 00:38:03,720
<i>The investigation team believes</i>

604
00:38:03,800 --> 00:38:06,600
that after Ma Ke's team
received a two-million bribe

605
00:38:06,680 --> 00:38:07,960
from Director Peng,

606
00:38:08,040 --> 00:38:10,240
they revised the consulting plan

607
00:38:10,320 --> 00:38:12,720
to induce Celestial
to purchase IP services

608
00:38:12,800 --> 00:38:14,040
from a company connected to Director Peng.

609
00:38:14,120 --> 00:38:15,800
Here's the evidence.

610
00:38:15,880 --> 00:38:19,400
One, in the chat records
between Ma Ke and Peng Yuan,

611
00:38:19,480 --> 00:38:22,080
Peng Yuan hinted
that changing the entire IT architecture

612
00:38:22,160 --> 00:38:23,480
would be better for Celestial's future.

613
00:38:23,560 --> 00:38:25,840
And after introducing a familiar vendor,

614
00:38:25,920 --> 00:38:28,040
he said he'd thank Ma Ke later.

615
00:38:28,120 --> 00:38:30,120
I HAVE TO THANK YOU IN PERSON FOR THIS
LET'S MEET AT THE USUAL PLACE

616
00:38:30,200 --> 00:38:31,040
Two.

617
00:38:31,120 --> 00:38:31,960
FOOTAGE FROM THE CAFÉ ON THE 29TH

618
00:38:32,040 --> 00:38:34,040
The café surveillance footage shows

619
00:38:34,720 --> 00:38:38,680
that on the 29th,
the two did meet at Century Mall.

620
00:38:38,760 --> 00:38:40,920
Director Peng gave Ma Ke a tennis bag.

621
00:38:44,600 --> 00:38:47,960
Three, Yang Rui admitted that afterward,

622
00:38:48,040 --> 00:38:52,240
Ma Ke did ask him to suggest changing

623
00:38:52,320 --> 00:38:54,720
Celestial's entire IT system
architecture in the proposal.

624
00:38:55,640 --> 00:38:57,440
The evidence is rock solid.

625
00:38:57,520 --> 00:39:00,320
Our company's Inspection Department
is all ex-economic crimes investigators.

626
00:39:00,400 --> 00:39:02,040
Xu Chi probably
can't talk her way out of it.

627
00:39:06,960 --> 00:39:09,160
- You can't go in!
- Here for the meeting!

628
00:39:22,920 --> 00:39:24,160
LEGAL DEPARTMENT

629
00:39:24,240 --> 00:39:26,400
Miss Xu, this involves you directly.
You can't go in.

630
00:39:27,720 --> 00:39:28,720
Don't make me lose my temper.

631
00:39:29,440 --> 00:39:30,920
She really can't go in.

632
00:39:31,440 --> 00:39:33,960
I won't go in.
Can I just edit the slides here?

633
00:39:34,480 --> 00:39:36,560
Zhao Heng. Do me a favor.

634
00:39:36,640 --> 00:39:39,120
- Hold this bag up. I'll record a video.
- Okay.

635
00:39:39,200 --> 00:39:41,680
I’ve used wireless screen
casting in this meeting room before.

636
00:39:41,760 --> 00:39:43,120
I should be able to do it
outside of the door.

637
00:39:43,200 --> 00:39:45,440
All this evidence…

638
00:39:45,520 --> 00:39:46,880
- What's going on?
- Exactly.

639
00:39:46,960 --> 00:39:48,400
- What's happening?
- I don't know.

640
00:39:48,480 --> 00:39:49,680
- What's this?
- What's going on?

641
00:39:49,760 --> 00:39:51,960
- No idea.
- What's happening?

642
00:39:52,040 --> 00:39:52,800
I'M XU CHI. I'M RIGHT OUTSIDE THE DOOR

643
00:39:52,880 --> 00:39:54,160
Director Peng?

644
00:39:54,240 --> 00:39:55,600
I HAVE EVIDENCE CELESTIAL'S DIRECTOR PENG
HAS BEEN DECEIVING THE INVESTIGATION TEAM

645
00:40:00,680 --> 00:40:03,320
CAMERA SHOWS MA KE MET DIRECTOR PENG

646
00:40:03,400 --> 00:40:07,320
THEN WALKED OFF WITH
THE SO-CALLED TWO MILLION. BUT!

647
00:40:09,880 --> 00:40:11,720
HE DOESN'T KNOW TWO MILLION
IN CASH WEIGHS AT LEAST 26 KILOGRAMS!

648
00:40:11,800 --> 00:40:13,520
WE PUT 25 KILOS OF DUMBBELLS
IN THE SAME TENNIS BAG

649
00:40:13,600 --> 00:40:15,200
EVERYONE, TAKE A LOOK
NO ONE COULD CARRY THAT OFF SO EASILY

650
00:40:18,640 --> 00:40:21,320
THE BAG'S DEFORMED. IT'S HARD TO CARRY!

651
00:40:34,400 --> 00:40:36,520
We're in a meeting.
Can't let any involved parties in.

652
00:40:44,680 --> 00:40:45,680
I just need five minutes.

653
00:40:51,240 --> 00:40:54,000
Director Peng insists
he and Ma Ke met in private many times

654
00:40:54,080 --> 00:40:55,520
to discuss things.

655
00:40:55,600 --> 00:40:58,400
One meeting was on the 18th
at 4 p.m. at Binhe Brewpub.

656
00:40:58,480 --> 00:41:01,040
Another was on the 25th at 7 p.m.
at Ohara Japanese Cuisine.

657
00:41:01,120 --> 00:41:03,720
But everyone, look at this.
Ma Ke has severe gout.

658
00:41:03,800 --> 00:41:06,600
This is his prescription from
a follow-up hospital visit on the 15th.

659
00:41:06,680 --> 00:41:10,440
Everyone knows beer and seafood
are the worst things for gout.

660
00:41:10,520 --> 00:41:12,880
So how credible is Director Peng's story?

661
00:41:14,640 --> 00:41:16,280
That's just circumstantial.

662
00:41:16,360 --> 00:41:19,200
Maybe they were just talking
and not drinking at all.

663
00:41:19,960 --> 00:41:21,200
I have other evidence.

664
00:41:21,280 --> 00:41:22,680
HOSPITAL OUTPATIENT MEDICAL RECORD

665
00:41:22,760 --> 00:41:24,200
This is Ma Ke's phone.

666
00:41:24,280 --> 00:41:26,960
Ma Ke and I contacted
an engineer from Siwei Group

667
00:41:27,040 --> 00:41:28,400
to do a remote monitoring session.

668
00:41:29,120 --> 00:41:32,520
That's right. Siwei handles this phone's
after-sales service in China.

669
00:41:32,600 --> 00:41:34,120
The engineer already verified it.

670
00:41:34,200 --> 00:41:38,680
The system and apps on this phone
haven't been modified in any way.

671
00:41:38,760 --> 00:41:42,000
If anyone doubts it,
feel free to bring in a third party

672
00:41:42,080 --> 00:41:43,960
for a more professional,
accurate legal review.

673
00:41:44,560 --> 00:41:45,560
That's right.

674
00:41:45,640 --> 00:41:47,720
You may not know this, but this phone

675
00:41:47,800 --> 00:41:50,320
actually tracks
the owner's location history.

676
00:41:50,960 --> 00:41:51,920
Take a look, everyone.

677
00:41:53,000 --> 00:41:56,120
On the 18th at 4 p.m.,
Ma Ke was near the airport.

678
00:41:56,200 --> 00:41:59,080
There's no way he could've gotten
to Binhe Brewpub 15 kilometers away.

679
00:41:59,160 --> 00:42:01,040
Also, on the 25th,

680
00:42:01,120 --> 00:42:03,800
Ma Ke's location was very far
from Ohara Japanese Cuisine.

681
00:42:03,880 --> 00:42:06,480
Could all of this
just be Director Peng misremembering?

682
00:42:06,560 --> 00:42:08,040
It has that function?

683
00:42:08,120 --> 00:42:09,840
I need to check on my husband's phone.

684
00:42:09,920 --> 00:42:13,120
In short, I believe
the mid-term investigation report

685
00:42:13,200 --> 00:42:15,320
relied too heavily
on Director Peng's one-sided account.

686
00:42:15,400 --> 00:42:17,880
He's determined to drag our team
down with him. Maybe he's gambling.

687
00:42:17,960 --> 00:42:20,000
He's betting that
with two major companies cooperating,

688
00:42:20,080 --> 00:42:22,120
things can be swept under the rug.

689
00:42:22,200 --> 00:42:23,480
Mr. Zheng,

690
00:42:23,560 --> 00:42:25,600
please believe that Maxmise,

691
00:42:25,680 --> 00:42:28,280
as a top consulting firm,
operates with professional integrity.

692
00:42:29,160 --> 00:42:32,200
Maybe the tennis bag
just had a tennis racket in it?

693
00:42:43,680 --> 00:42:45,560
Everyone, please step outside
for a moment.

694
00:42:45,640 --> 00:42:47,000
Sha Sha. Yu.

695
00:42:47,520 --> 00:42:48,720
Let's have a quick meeting.
